OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be
OL,6,Fdry through the evening and overnight
OL,7,Fwith clear spells and light winds
OL,8,Fallowing a few fog patches and a touch
OL,9,Fof frost to develop in sheltered glens.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FA dry start with some
OL,12,Fbrightness towards the east coast at
OL,13,Ffirst but soon clouding over with a
OL,14,Ffew outbreaks of rain.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FEarly
OL,17,Frain clearing Tuesday morning, then
OL,18,Fsunshine and showers, windy at times.
OL,19,FWindy on Wednesday with bright spells,
OL,20,Frain likely later, this slowly
OL,21,Fclearing southeast later on Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
